### Base URL Configuration
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 0. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 1. GET All Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 2. GET Products with Search Query
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?search=keyboard

### 3. GET Products with Sort Query (Price Descending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?sortBy=price&order=desc

### 4. GET Single Product by ID (Valid)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1710000001

### 5. GET Single Product by ID (Not Found -> 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/non-existing-id

### 6. POST Create New Product (Success -> 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Noise Cancelling Headphones",
  "price": 3590,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 7. POST Create Product Validation Error (Missing Price -> 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Headphone Case"
}

### 8. PUT Update Product by ID (Success -> 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1710000001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mechanical Keyboard RGB",
  "price": 2790,
  "quantity": 10
}

### 9. PUT Update Product Not Found (404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/999999999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Item"
}

### 10. DELETE Product by ID (Success -> 200)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/1710000002

### 11. DELETE Product Not Found (404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/999999999
